: "A.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PSI 11.1208.15", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὑτῷ πόνους φῦσαι S. Ant. 647", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". in pres. seemingly intr., put forth shoots,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς ἔτος ἄλλο φύοντι Mosch. 3.101", "author_abbreviation": "Mosch.", "tlg_author": "0035", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δρύες . . φύοντι Theoc. 7.75", "author_abbreviation": "Theoc.", "tlg_author": "0005", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "4.24", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0005", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": so ἀνδρῶν γενεὴ ἡ μὲν φύει ἡ δ' ἀπολήγει one generation is putting forth scions, the other is ceasing to do so,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 6.149", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐν στήθεσι φύει (fort. φυίει) grows up, appears,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Alc. 97", "author_abbreviation": "Alc.", "tlg_author": "0383", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ῥίζα ἄνω φύουσα ἐν χολῇ LXX De. 29.18", "author_abbreviation": "LXX", "tlg_author": "0527", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". Pass. , with intr. tenses of Act. , aor. 2, pf. and plpf., grow, wax, spring up or forth, esp. of the vegetable world,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θάμνος ἔφυ ἐλαίης Od. 23.190", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "5.481", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πρασιαὶ παντοῖαι πεφύασιν 7.128", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τά γ' ἄσπαρτα φύονται 9.109", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 4.483", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "14.288", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "21.352", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φύεται αὐτόματα ῥόδα Hdt. 8.138", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.193", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὑπὸ φηγῷ πεφυκυίῃ growing there, Id. 2.56", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; πεφυκότα δένδρα trees growing there,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 4.3.5", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὰ φυόμενα καὶ τὰ γιγνόμενα Pl. Cra. 410d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Phd. 110d", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Plt. 272a", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τοῦ κέρα ἐκ κεφαλῆς ἑκκαιδεκάδωρα πεφύκει from his head grew horns sixteen palms long,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 4.109", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.108", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "3.133", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "φύονται πολιαί Pi. O. 4.28", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; κεφαλαὶ πεφυκυῖαι θριξί grown with hair,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D.S. 2.50", "author_abbreviation": "D.S.", "tlg_author": "0060", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(s. v.l.);"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πέφυκε λίθος ἐν αὐτῇ is produced, X. Vect. 1.4", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": metaph., νόσημα ἐν ὀλιγαρχίᾳ φυόμενον, φυομένη πόλις,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 564b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lg. 757d", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὁ σπέρμα παρασχών, οὗτος τῶν φύντων αἴτιος [κακῶν] of the things produced,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 18.159", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";